# Kept out of the Cloudflare static-asset upload. Classic Pages excluded
# .git and friends automatically; Workers static assets does not, and
# wrangler.toml points it at the repo root. Parity only — everything else
# stays served exactly as GitHub Pages serves it today.
.git
.github
node_modules
.DS_Store
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
worker

# The historical inspection workbook and everything derived from it. Remarks and
# notes in it carry gate combinations, logger security codes and key numbers —
# approved accounts only in the database, so never a public file here. They live
# in the private flood-net-private repository now (.gitignore keeps them out of
# this one); these lines are for a copy somebody drops into a checkout anyway.
archive/QLD All Site Inspections.xlsx
data/inspections
tools/ingest/inspection_extract_sample.json

# Never ship local secrets as static assets, even if one is present in the
# working tree at deploy time (appraisal L-12).
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.wrangler
